Iz7MH7cD/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@217_illu/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/581cc046/uploads/origins/963fa08f-a6a7-449a-be61-d2525f3868b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=456fcf53ffeec761fd632a8e13dbe1c5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/581cc046/uploads/origins/963fa08f-a6a7-449a-be61-d2525f3868b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=456fcf53ffeec761fd632a8e13dbe1c5, https://si.imgix.net/581cc046/uploads/origins/963fa08f-a6a7-449a-be61-d2525f3868b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=502e68b36958279171dd065faed27295 2x, https://si.imgix.net/581cc046/uploads/origins/963fa08f-a6a7-449a-be61-d2525f3868b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43bd3440f3c22a0f34092a9be3b59a15 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のオオカミのキャラクターを巨人として描いていただけませんか？\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Lb-3PbbOyS08xq04xLJKuDF41MJcp2jF\n\n彼は背が高く、見る人を見下ろしているはずです。\n街を見下ろすように描けたら最高です！\n\n目は紫で、左耳に噛み跡がある。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@217_illu/works/50", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d262d547/uploads/origins/7e416dc9-5631-41f6-9ee6-09a36b0aac2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1ff2ab666b7d1160bdf5953ea2937ec2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d262d547/uploads/origins/7e416dc9-5631-41f6-9ee6-09a36b0aac2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1ff2ab666b7d1160bdf5953ea2937ec2, https://si.imgix.net/d262d547/uploads/origins/7e416dc9-5631-41f6-9ee6-09a36b0aac2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtsh